h the effects of a 7th-level <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.kqhPt9344UkcGVYO]{Resurrect}</em> ritual. This deals @Damage[10d10[void]] damage to the host (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:37|basic:true] save). An jadrani who died within an area devoted to a good deity by a <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.Dbd5W6G8U2vzWolN]{Consecrate}</em> ritual can't self-resurrect, and an jadrani can self-resurrect only once per year.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["curse","death","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":true,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"OUNwkHoMieLHOZaM","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688759742872,"modifiedTime":1691261013458,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Fountain of Youth","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>60 feet. When a living creature ends its turn in the aura, it must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:34] save. If the creature fails, its body regresses, reversing muscle development, balance, and coordination. The creature appears superficially youthful for 1 day but is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} while the appearance of youth lasts.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":60}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","occult"]},"publicati